      "value": "@{66fdd842a092a936c9145f7a|full_name} so far you can only take images in game, not sure why they did it this way.\n\nExcerpt from their changelog:\n\nName Plates\n\nThe big one -- we're updating Name Plates. They look different now!\n\nOur goal has been to try to reorganize a lot of the information that was presented by the previous nameplate, while also modernizing the design and providing additional customization options.\n\nTo that end, you'll notice the User Profile Icon is now always visible. That's because the user icon is no longer a VRC+ feature -- now everyone can have an icon. For now, those without VRC+ will be limited to using the in-game camera to create an icon.\n\nWe expect you might have a lot of feedback! We want it! This design has room to evolve. While we've tried to think of everything we can, we know you'll likely have some great ideas.",
